{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a7b09aa9dc5a833da014","chatId":"22165b993efc47e0ba9f4c0aff471af9","sessionId":null,"userId":99737,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1325,"promptTokens":532,"completionTokens":113,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:49:04"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908367301430801,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7b09aa9dc5a833da013","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484144914,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:49:04","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a7b09aa9dc5a833da013","chatId":"22165b993efc47e0ba9f4c0aff471af9","sessionId":null,"userId":99737,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小帕是一名热情的足球运动员，他在高中足球队踢球。整年来，他一直努力练习，以赢得锦标赛。在比赛的最后一天，他的腿受伤了。然而，他仍决定完成比赛。令人吃惊的是，小帕打进了最后一个进球，带领球队获胜。然而，比赛结束后，他发现他的伤势严重到需要数周的医疗休息。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小帕最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 感激 & 紧张\nB) 紧张 & 愧疚\nC) 自豪 & 绝望\nD) 伤感 & 愧疚\nE) 自豪 & 伤感\nF) 绝望 & 伤感\n\n## 问题 2\n小帕为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他在一段时间内不能追求热爱的足球运动了 & 他是团队中最好的球员\nB) 他在受伤的情况下帮助他的球队取得了胜利 & 他在一段时间内不能追求热爱的足球运动了\nC) 虽然他受伤了，但他还是完成了比赛 & 他的球队在没有他的情况下赢得了冠军\nD) 他是团队中最好的球员 & 他在比赛中不能再进球\nE) 他在受伤的情况下帮助他的球队取得了胜利 & 他在比赛中不能再进球\nF) 他在受伤的情况下帮助他的球队取得了胜利 & 他的球队在没有他的情况下赢得了冠军","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908367301430801,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7b09aa9dc5a833da014","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484144911,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:49:04","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"b4e3dcdd14354d188984b87341df66df"}